{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262I7vWH2oAc1794473655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>探源計劃探路者衛星，成功發射並進入預定軌道。</p><p></p><p>搭載探路者衛星的長征二號丁運載火箭，周三晚在酒泉衛星發射中心，成功發射升空。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SATELLITE-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026x7xJ7vt6MU1794473666.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>探路者衛星，是太空探源系列科學衛星計劃的技術試驗星，將對「鴻蒙計劃」、「夸父二號」，以及國家空間科學中長期發展規劃中，具有重大應用前景的有效載荷關鍵技術，進行在軌驗證，並開展在軌試驗。其後亦會開展空間環境監測示範探測和研究，衛星設計壽命2年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.637525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:07:30.155907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:27.720134+00:00","content_hash":"7eb2d0dd106f6ddaadaad593c25881c59dd2030e48f52d3c4c749f0f29eed421","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.637525+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}